From 82ee83cf79605f27c93d99c444a3aeb316b968b0 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Rico Rojas <rickrojas@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 10 Sep 2026 00:00:19 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] feat(crm): sync notes to contact and company timelines

Add write-only encrypted CRM settings, contact/company selection and creation,
and summary-first note activities through a main-process IPC boundary. Persist
the CRM activity identity so repeated syncs update one record and preserve
the latest saved note and speaker labels.

Include contract, SQLite, IPC, and credential tests plus the CRM-side API
contract checker. Refs #6, #7, #8, #9, #10, #11.
