diff --git a/docs/crm-connector.md b/docs/crm-connector.md
new file mode 100644
index 00000000..f992226a
--- /dev/null
+++ b/docs/crm-connector.md
@@ -0,0 +1,38 @@
+# CRM connector contract
+
+OpenWhispr stores the CRM API base URL, browser app URL, and workspace slug in
+`crm-settings.json` under Electron `userData`. The API key is stored separately
+through the encrypted secret store. Renderer calls receive only `hasApiKey` and
+never receive the key itself.
+
+Wire requests use the configured base URL, the `/rest` prefix, and the
+`x-api-key` header. The connector requires:
+
+- `GET /rest/search?q=a` for connection checks
+- `POST /rest/contacts/search` and `POST /rest/companies/search` for target lookup
+- `POST /rest/contacts` and `POST /rest/companies` for creation
+- `POST /rest/activities` for the first note sync
+- `PATCH /rest/activities/{id}` for later syncs of the same note. The frozen
+  update contract accepts only `subject`, `body`, and `occurredAt`; delivery is
+  tracked by rtech-consulting#379.
+
+A successful note sync stores the activity and target identifiers, the sync
+time, and a hash scoped to the API URL, workspace, and account key. Repeated or
+concurrent syncs update one activity. A missing activity is recreated only when
+the CRM returns a structured `NOT_FOUND`; ambiguous failures do not create a
+duplicate. An existing activity cannot be reassigned to another contact or
+company; callers receive `TARGET_CHANGED` before any CRM request or receipt
+write. Redirects, timeouts, malformed responses, and unsuccessful writes
+leave the saved receipt unchanged. Renderer errors are sanitized.
+
+Browser links use `<appUrl>/<workspaceSlug>/contacts/<id>` or
+`<appUrl>/<workspaceSlug>/companies/<id>`.
+
+Check a server's read-only OpenAPI document with:
+
+```sh
+/opt/homebrew/opt/node@24/bin/node scripts/check-crm-contract.js http://crm-host.example.internal:8081
+```
+
+This checks the published API shape only. It does not authenticate or create,
+update, or search CRM records, and it does not prove the connector is deployed.
